\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/MvonRen/status/1856801963834314854\">https://x.com/MvonRen/status/1856801963834314854</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1857009987387580817</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1857009987387580817\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-11-14T10:37:37Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1857067289423540356":{"a":"<p>@covertress Trigone Igneo. &quot;We cannot save them all but we must try to save the ones we can.&quot; 🔺</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1857059233566490770\">https://x.com/i/status/1857059233566490770</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1857067289423540356</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1857067289423540356\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-11-14T14:25:19Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1857093546286665792":{"a":"<p>@covertress @DisclosureWith I attended some NASA forum sessions on &quot;Earth is Mars&quot; and had lunch with one of their folks about 6 years ago. The significance of that title is lost on most people. We have to figure this out now, while we can, or Earth will end up like Mars is today. We need to get to Mars. 🙏</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1857073792163487924\">https://x.com/i/status/1857073792163487924</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1857093546286665792</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1857093546286665792\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-11-14T16:09:39Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1857095173911527435":{"a":"<p>@covertress @DisclosureWith Life is self replicating. What we lack is sufficient energy. There&#x27;s more to growing life than sunlight and dirt and water. We will have the ability to replicate objects precisely with enough energy however it won&#x27;t be alive without a base level of energy to sustain its EM field.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1857093546286665792\">https://x.com/i/status/1857093546286665792</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1857095173911527435</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1857095173911527435\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-11-14T16:16:07Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1857096310203076700":{"a":"<p>@SubRosaMagick Woohoo, $50 would be great right about now. I&#x27;ve more than paid my debts, imho. 😂🙏</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1857023171146498548\">https://x.com/i/status/1857023171146498548</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/SubRosaMagick/status/1857023171146498548\">https://x.com/SubRosaMagick/status/1857023171146498548</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1857096310203076700</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1857096310203076700\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-11-14T16:20:38Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1857096600205623337":{"a":"<p>RT @SubRosaMagick: Claim it and retweet! t.co</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1857023171146498548\">https://x.com/i/status/1857023171146498548</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1857096600205623337\">https://x.